{"id":121046726033836,"name":"REALISTIC OutWest Chicago HOOD TESTING","desc":"Welcome to OutWest Chicago HOOD TESTING 🌃\n\nExperience a realistic hood-style gun testing environment, centered around firearms and street-level PvP.\n\n Looking for a deeper experience? Check out the full version of the game by searching Chicago Nexus or visiting our group page!\n\n[How to Play]\n🎲 Spawn with a randomized loadout\n⚔️ Engage in PvP combat with other players\n🔓 Build killstreaks to unlock special weaponry\n\n💡 Note: All firearms deal consistent base damage; there are no headshot multipliers.\n\n🖥️ PC Controls\nLeft-Click: Shoot\nRight-Click: ADS\nR: Reload\nShift: Run\n\n🎮 Console Controls\nR2: Shoot\nL2: ADS\nX: Reload\nL3: Run\n\n🔫 Gamepass Selection Menu\n• PC/Mobile: Tap the top bar button\n• Console: Press the D-Pad Up button\n\nHave suggestions, found a bug, or need to report an exploiter? Join the Server Communications socials below!","path":"/game/121046726033836-realistic-outwest-chicago-hood-testing","slug":"121046726033836-realistic-outwest-chicago-hood-testing","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4eee3f8e92154fa3d2e11ac372ee8f8069c936f0edad574ffbd5949ea2ff921a.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a7ad227586d42de46c49395a27cc8836/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":79,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-02-15T14:49:49.040Z","creator":{"name":"OGkiller4x","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"REALISTIC-OutWest-Chicago-HOOD-TESTING-Hitbox-111894","_id":"6991dd0d1a5b2310137f1d53","title":"Hitbox","game":{"_id":"6991dd0d1a5b2310137f1d50","gameId":121046726033836,"name":"REALISTIC OutWest Chicago HOOD TESTING","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":121046726033836},"features":"https://www.roblox.com/games/121046726033836/REAL